#: ../../contribute/changelog.md:1 50f77ac8e8f14311a5e4b1ecf10859b1
msgid "📋 Changelog"
msgstr "📋 更新日志"

#: ../../contribute/changelog.md:3 a4f9fb298c9a405589bd0dddf2b78a82
msgid ""
"Each module has its own `CHANGELOG.md` file. It tells users what changed."
" It also sets the next version of the module."
msgstr "每个模块都有自己的 `CHANGELOG.md` 文件。它告诉用户发生了哪些变化，还决定模块的下一个版本号。"

#: ../../contribute/changelog.md:7 19b9efb02a294022a0e3b19b9bf2940c
msgid "Format"
msgstr "格式"

#: ../../contribute/changelog.md:21 8291f62c5bb94657a23a654abf322e5f
msgid ""
"Keep the `## Unreleased` section at the top. Add one line there for each "
"change."
msgstr "将 `## Unreleased` 部分保持在顶部。每项变更在其中添加一行。"

#: ../../contribute/changelog.md:22 9ca90b3b0ccb4590a25f401a4bcc88ed
msgid ""
"Start each line with an emoji. Describe the change for users. Link the "
"issue or the pull request."
msgstr "每一行以一个表情符号开头。面向用户描述变更。链接到相应的议题或拉取请求。"

#: ../../contribute/changelog.md:23 fc3a7d5879da42a599a5e0970b0ced5d
msgid ""
"Don't add version sections, such as `` ## `v1.0.0` ``. The release "
"process creates them."
msgstr "不要添加版本部分，例如 `` ## `v1.0.0` ``。发布流程会创建它们。"

